window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"darius","b":"masteryi","win":["Darius","Darius","Darius","Darius","Skill","Master Yi","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 2","text":"The outer-blade heal plus a 535-range Apprehend keeps him off the wave entirely — starve him."},{"when":"Lvl 3","text":"One pull means a stacked bleed he can't sustain through — every trade he takes is potentially lethal."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Alpha Strike goes untargetable and eats a Guillotine cast — but Apprehend cancels Meditate."},{"when":"1st item","text":"The flip: attack speed multiplies Wuju Style's true damage, so armour is the wrong buy. Open with E and Grievous Wounds."}],"wants":{"you":["A huge lead before his items","Pulls that start every fight","Pull him out of Meditate"],"foe":["Farm quietly to first item","Alpha through your Guillotine","Clean duels with no pull"]},"early":"Stomp the door shut early. Decimate's outer blade out-ranges and out-heals anything he does at 1, level 2 adds the Apprehend threat at 535 that keeps him off the wave, and by 3 one pull means a stacked bleed he can't sustain through. Zone him off every CS and force the lane so far ahead his scaling arrives late.","mid":"He gets slippery at 6 — Alpha Strike is 20s and untargetable, and his own basic attacks shorten it, so deny him autos and hold R until it is burned. Apprehend cancels a Meditate channel outright. His first item is the flip: stop taking clean fights, start every one with E, and fight inside your minions.","late":"Wuju Style's true damage wins any duel where the pull misses, and Highlander at 85s makes him immune to slows, so Crippling Strike and Stridebreaker stop sticking the second he presses it. Sidelane in a minion sea, flash-E when it kills, and in fights stack bleeds mid-scrum — five stacks plus resets still murder him.","whys":["Darius owns level 1 — Decimate out-ranges and out-trades his weak early autos, and the outer blade heals back his scratches.","Level 2 stays yours: the outer-blade heal plus Apprehend's 535 threat keeps him off the wave, starved.","Level 3 is yours — Hemorrhage stacking and the pull make any trade he takes potentially lethal. He farms at your pleasure.","Levels 4-5 stay Darius's: your full combo out-damages his pre-item kit in every committed exchange.","Level 6 goes even — Alpha Strike is untargetable and slips your Guillotine, though Apprehend still cancels Meditate mid-channel.","First item is Master Yi's: his attack-speed spike out-DPSes you in a clean fight. Never fight clean — open with the pull or don't open at all.","Two-plus items stay his — Wuju Style's true damage wins any duel where he dodges the E, and Highlander's slow immunity means Crippling Strike never sticks."]});
